245
00:14:56,420 --> 00:14:59,538
Yugi Moto just like we
rehearsed it a thousand times!

246
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:03,020
Sheesh, who knew Ziggy
was such a stage mom?

247
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:05,600
I won't let you down, bro.

248
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:08,336
Let's get back to business, shall we?

249
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,840
I don't believe it!

250
00:15:10,060 --> 00:15:12,137
That means everything
Leon said to us about his

251
00:15:12,220 --> 00:15:15,420
dreams of becoming a champion
duelist was one big lie!

252
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,544
I'll get to the bottom of this.

253
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:21,600
Tell me, Leon, are you really
here to destroy Kaiba Corp?

254
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:24,820
Or are you letting your
brother control who you are?

255
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:27,020
The truth will set you free!

256
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:29,440
Listen, Leon.

257
00:15:29,820 --> 00:15:32,297
Don't let these do-gooders
turn you against me.

258
00:15:32,380 --> 00:15:35,577
They will never understand what
our family has been through.

259
00:15:35,660 --> 00:15:39,177
Now go ahead and crush
Yugi Moto so you can obtain

260
00:15:39,260 --> 00:15:42,142
the championship title
you so rightfully deserve.

261
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:47,760
It's your duty as a Schroeder.
I know. Hold on. Save it.

262
00:15:47,900 --> 00:15:49,018
My brother's right.

263
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:50,454
You just don't get it.

264
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:53,937
Trust me, I know what you
were just about to say, Yugi.

265
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:56,760
That dueling in order
to get revenge is wrong.

266
00:15:57,100 --> 00:15:59,257
But my brother never
asked for my help before,

267
00:15:59,340 --> 00:16:01,987
and now for the first
time ever, he needs me.

268
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:04,840
I'm sorry, but I can't let him down.

269
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:10,965
Ever since I can remember, Siegfried was
the most important member of our family.

270
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,340
Hey, Ziggy.

271
00:16:13,300 --> 00:16:16,006
Check out this new fairy
tale book I just got.

272
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:18,402
Don't bother your brother, Leon.

273
00:16:18,660 --> 00:16:21,895
It's time for his lessons
now, and he must concentrate.

274
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:25,260
Now remember, Siegfried,
you must study very hard.

275
00:16:25,700 --> 00:16:27,937
Your father can't run
Schrodercorp forever,

276
00:16:28,020 --> 00:16:31,196
and someday our family
business will be in your hands.

277
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:36,780
As for you, see to it that your brother
isn't distracted by all of your noise!

278
00:16:37,560 --> 00:16:39,540
I promise I won't make a peep.

279
00:16:41,140 --> 00:16:45,964
With everyone's attention focused on
Siegfried, I was pretty much forgotten about.

280
00:16:46,060 --> 00:16:48,001
So I learned to entertain myself.

281
00:16:48,340 --> 00:16:50,928
I spent most of my time
reading fairy tales.

282
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:52,150
It was fun,

283
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:56,177
but part of me still wished there was
something I could do to help my family.

284
00:16:56,260 --> 00:16:57,620
Just like Siegfried.

285
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:04,920
Then I discovered the game of Duel
Monsters, and my life was never the same.

286
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:07,340
I play this!

287
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:19,060
I guess I just had a knack for dueling.

288
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:22,520
And the winner is Leon Wilson!

289
00:17:23,340 --> 00:17:26,222
I changed my name so my
family wouldn't find out.

290
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:28,880
Nice dueling.

291
00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:31,320
You found me.

292
00:17:32,460 --> 00:17:33,420
Are you mad?

293
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:34,980
Of course not.

294
00:17:35,180 --> 00:17:37,937
I came to congratulate you
on your latest victory.

295
00:17:38,020 --> 00:17:39,060
Look at you,

296
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:41,417
hacking into tournament
computer systems and

297
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:44,618
creating phony identities
like a little secret agent.

298
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:47,160
Who knew you were so devious?

299
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:48,873
Don't tell Mom and Dad.

300
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,957
You know there's no way they
would understand, Siegfried.

301
00:17:52,040 --> 00:17:55,537
But I love dueling more than
anything, so I did whatever it took.

302
00:17:55,620 --> 00:17:58,640
There's no need to explain yourself to me.

303
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:04,025
I'm just glad that I'm finally getting
the chance to bond with my little brother.

304
00:18:04,620 --> 00:18:06,020
Let me rephrase.

305
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:10,757
My talented little brother, who seems to
possess all sorts of hidden abilities.

306
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:15,487
Abilities he should be using to help his
big brother run their family business.

307
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,800
You need me? You mean it?

308
00:18:19,020 --> 00:18:19,850
Leon,

309
00:18:19,933 --> 00:18:23,757
you have a gift that could help thrust
Schroeder Corp straight up to number one.

310
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:26,297
Just tell me whatever you need, Siegfried.

311
00:18:26,380 --> 00:18:29,262
I'd do anything to be a
part of our family again.

312
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,230
Anything!

313
00:18:33,180 --> 00:18:36,340
I promise you'll never be alone again.

314
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:38,500
See, Yugi?

315
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:40,801
I'm not just fighting for myself.

316
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:42,717
I'm fighting for my whole family.

317
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:44,120
Now let's duel!

318
00:18:45,840 --> 00:18:48,780
So Leon was brainwashed into dueling us?

319
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:52,960
He should play for his love of the
game, not his family's vengeance.

320
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:54,845
Deep down, he knows that, too.

321
00:18:55,160 --> 00:18:56,580
I believe it's my turn.

322
00:18:56,880 --> 00:19:01,440
So, I'll start things off by
summoning this card, Iron Hans.

323
00:19:02,140 --> 00:19:05,357
But that's not all, because once
this monster's on the field,

324
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:08,969
it allows me to automatically
summon my Iron Knight as well.

325
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:13,897
Get ready to step down, because
there's a new champion in town,

326
00:19:13,980 --> 00:19:16,240
and his name is Leon Bon Schroeder.

327
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:19,600
Now I summon my Iron Knight.

328
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:28,520
I knew you wouldn't let me down, Leon

329
00:19:32,100 --> 00:19:33,180
I win

330
00:19:36,540 --> 00:19:41,460
You have one monster and I have
three So before this turn is done,

331
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:44,600
your former title will
belong to Schroderkorn

332
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:16,360
YOLA YOLA YOLA YOLA
